<http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Paper:2010_FRP_Structural_Performance_of_CFRP-Strengthened_RC_slabs_in_a_corrosive_Environment.pdf> a es:Paper ;
    es:aiSummary "该文献研究了腐蚀环境对碳纤维增强聚合物（CFRP）加固钢筋混凝土（RC）板结构性能的影响。通过8个试件的单调静态加载实验，比较了不同加固方案和腐蚀条件下的结构表现。结果表明腐蚀会劣化未加固试件的性能，而CFRP加固能有效提升抗弯承载力。"^^xsd:string ;
    es:autoKeywords "corrosion, CFRP, RC slabs, structural performance, strengthening schemes"^^xsd:string ;
    es:confidence 0.85 ;
    es:doi "10.1061//H20849ASCE/H20850CC.1943-5614.0000133"^^xsd:string ;
    es:hasAuthor <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Author:Mohamed_Hussein1_and_Tarek_M._Fawzy2_1Associate_Professor_Dept._of_Structural_Engineering_Faculty_of_Engineering_Tanta_Univ._Tanta_Egypt_corresponding_author_._E-mail_m_hussein_20_yahoo.com_2Professor_of_Concrete_Structures_Tanta_Univ._Tanta_Egypt._E-mail_telakrat_yahoo.com> ;
    es:hasKeyword <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:cfrp>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:corrosion>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:rc_slabs>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:strengthening_schemes>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:structural_performance> ;
    es:paperType "期刊论文" ;
    es:publishedIn <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Venue:Journal_of_Composites> ;
    es:related_to <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#LocalFile:_2010_FRP_Structural_Performance_of_CFRP-Strengthened_RC_slabs_in_a_corrosive_Environment.pdf> ;
    es:sourcedFrom <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#LocalFile:_2010_FRP_Structural_Performance_of_CFRP-Strengthened_RC_slabs_in_a_corrosive_Environment.pdf> ;
    es:title "Structural Performance of CFRP-Strengthened RC Slabs in a Corrosive Environment"^^xsd:string .

<http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Paper:2022_ECC_FRP_ECCsUHPFRCCs_with_and_without_FRP_reinforcement_for_structural_strengtheningrepairing_A_state-of-the-art_review.pdf> a es:Paper ;
    es:aiSummary "该文献系统综述了ECCs/UHPFRCCs在结构加固中的应用特性，比较了有无FRP网格增强的加固层性能差异。研究指出FRP网格可作为内部拉伸增强材料提升UHPFRCC加固层的抗拉性能，证实了高性能水泥基复合材料在结构修复中的可行性。"^^xsd:string ;
