    es:sourcedFrom <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#LocalFile:_2022_ECC_FRP_ECCsUHPFRCCs_with_and_without_FRP_reinforcement_for_structural_strengtheningrepairing_A_state-of-the-art_review.pdf> ;
    es:title "ECCs/UHPFRCCs with and without FRP reinforcement for structural strengthening/repairing: A state-of-the-art review"^^xsd:string .

<http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Paper:2022_The_greening_of_engineered_cementitious_composites_ECC_A_review.pdf> a es:Paper ;
    es:aiSummary "该文献综述了工程水泥基复合材料（ECC）的可持续性改进方向，重点探讨了通过环保结合剂（如粉煤灰）、再生填料和纤维增强材料降低建筑碳足迹的技术路径。研究指出绿色ECC开发需平衡环境效益与力学性能优化，特别强调粉煤灰作为低碳结合剂的潜力及替代方案的必要性。"^^xsd:string ;
    es:autoKeywords "sustainable construction, engineered cementitious composites, fly ash, green materials, self-healing concrete"^^xsd:string ;
    es:confidence 0.9 ;
    es:doi "10.1016/j.conbuildmat.2022.126701"^^xsd:string ;
    es:hasAuthor <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Author:Daiki_Shoji> ;
    es:hasKeyword <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:engineered_cementitious_composites>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:fly_ash>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:green_materials>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:self-healing_concrete>,
        <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Keyword:sustainable_construction> ;
    es:paperType "期刊论文" ;
    es:publishedIn <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Venue:composites_ECC_A_review> ;
    es:related_to <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#LocalFile:2022_The_greening_of_engineered_cementitious_composites_ECC_A_review.pdf> ;
    es:sourcedFrom <http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#LocalFile:2022_The_greening_of_engineered_cementitious_composites_ECC_A_review.pdf> ;
    es:title "The greening of engineered cementitious composites (ECC): A review"^^xsd:string .

<http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Paper:CFRP___.pdf> a es:Paper ;
    es:aiSummary "该文献研究小拱高跨比多拱桥结构设计优化方案，通过改进拱轴系数与局部细节设计提升结构性能。实验表明传统电缆接头拼接方案无法满足弯矩需求，而悬挂吊篮浇筑工艺可有效解决该问题。"^^xsd:string ;
