<http://edu-scholar.org/ontology#Paper:Effect_of_engineered_cementitious_composite_on_the_bond_behavior_between_fiber-reinforced_polymer_and_concrete.pdf> a es:Paper ;
    es:aiSummary "该文献研究了工程水泥基复合材料（ECC）对纤维增强聚合物（FRP）与混凝土间粘结行为的影响。通过剪切试验分析了ECC厚度、表面处理及施工方法对FRP-混凝土界面性能的影响，发现ECC能有效延缓FRP剥离并提升结构承载力与延展性。"^^xsd:string ;
    es:autoKeywords "engineered cementitious composite, fiber-reinforced polymer, bond behavior, concrete, shear tests"^^xsd:string ;
    es:confidence 0.95 ;
